  <Docs>
    <summary>Base class for a service that the <c>android.app.role.RoleManager.ROLE_CONTENT_SAFETY</c> role
            holder must implement.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Base class for a service that the android.app.role.RoleManager.ROLE_CONTENT_SAFETY role holder must implement.</para>
      <para>When the content safety subsystem is enabled and an app calls ContentSafetyManager.requestContentClassification, the system service will call onClassifyContent(ClassifiableContent).</para>
      <code lang="text/java">&lt;service android:name=".SampleContentSafetyAppService"
         android:permission="android.permission.BIND_CONTENT_SAFETY_SERVICE"
         android:privateComputeCore="true"&gt;
    &lt;intent-filter&gt;
        &lt;action android:name="android.app.action.CONTENT_SAFETY_SERVICE" /&gt;
    &lt;/intent-filter&gt;
 &lt;/service&gt;</code>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/service/contentsafety/ContentSafetyAppService" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.service.contentsafety.ContentSafetyAppService</code>.</a></format></para>
